data/beck_banks.rda
-------------------

Derived from the replication data for:

    Beck, T., Levine, R. and Levkov, A. (2010). "Big Bad Banks? The Winners
    and Losers from Bank Deregulation in the United States." The Journal of
    Finance 65(5), 1637-1667. doi:10.1111/j.1540-6261.2010.01589.x

deposited by the authors at DataverseNL, doi:10.34894/B1K9OU, and released
under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International licence:

    https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

CC BY 4.0 permits redistribution, including as part of this package,
provided that attribution is given, the licence is identified, and any
changes are indicated.

Changes made: a subset of the deposited columns was selected and the
remaining columns discarded. No values were altered, recoded or derived.
The selection is reproduced by data-raw/beck_banks.R.

Attribution and licence information are repeated in the dataset's own help
page; see ?beck_banks.
